# Hero draw (Idle Party)

The player sees the cutout skeleton (`HeroRigPainter`) for warrior, rogue,
mage, and healer. GEAR, the dungeon, and the party HUD all paint through it.

The still paper doll (`paintOwnedHero`) is the fallback before that atlas
is ready, and the picture the lookbook measures. A green lookbook is the
rest pose.

Judge a moving hero on the skeleton. Use the paper doll for the pictures
the bones are cut from, and for the rest check. Form sprites stay on their
own PNG.
